=== grove_gardener ===
"Careful where you tread. Every one of these is worth more than your street." #speaker:gardener
-> END

=== grove_cloche ===
A single seedling under a glass dome, kept like a treasure.
-> END

=== grove_saplings ===
Young trees in tubs, leaning towards the light. Nothing grows like this in the roots.
-> END

=== grove_seed_vault ===
{ grove_sneak: The vault. Get to it without the guard seeing you. -> END }
A locked cabinet of glass jars. The seeds inside glow a warm amber.
-> END
